# Tailwind + shadcn/ui

- Prefer Tailwind utility classes over custom CSS unless it’s truly global (`src/app/globals.css`).
- Use `cn(...)` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classnames (don’t hand-roll).
- Reuse primitives in `src/components/ui/*` rather than duplicating button/input/card variants.
- Keep design tokens consistent with CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css` (light/dark values are defined there).
